    "creating a variable": "创建变量",
    "specifying a variable’s default value": "指定变量的默认值",
    /* === batch-translated (auto-merged) === */
    "A variable is a symbolic representation of data that enables you to access a value without having to enter it manually wherever you need it. This can be useful if you're using the same values in multiple places. Variables make your requests more flexible and readable by abstracting the detail away.": "变量是数据的符号化表示，让你无需在每个需要的地方手动输入即可访问某个值。当你在多处使用相同的值时，这会很有用。变量将细节抽象出来，使你的请求更灵活、更易读。",
    "Define a vault secret in your Postman Vault.": "在你的 Postman Vault 中定义一个保险库密钥。",
    "Define an environment variable in the current environment.": "在当前环境中定义一个环境变量。",
    "For example, your team could have a shared API key and individual API keys. You could do experimental development work locally using your personal key, but use the shared key for team collaboration.": "例如，你的团队可以有一个共享 API 密钥和各自的独立 API 密钥。你可以用个人密钥在本地做实验性开发，而用共享密钥进行团队协作。",
    "If a variable with the same name is declared in two different scopes, the value stored in the variable with narrowest scope will be used. For example, if there is a \"username\" global variable and a \"username\" local variable, the local value is used when the request runs.": "如果同名变量在两个不同作用域中声明，将使用作用域最窄的那个变量的值。例如，如果同时存在名为 \"username\" 的全局变量和 \"username\" 的局部变量，则请求运行时使用局部值。",
    "If the variable without a scope has the \"vault:\" prefix (for example, \"vault:postman-api-key\"), you can only add it to your Postman Vault as a vault secret.": "如果无作用域的变量带有 \"vault:\" 前缀（例如 \"vault:postman-api-key\"），你只能将其作为保险库密钥添加到 Postman Vault 中。",
    "If you don't have Editor access to an environment, your script code will affect the local value but won't be synced or shared with your team.": "如果你没有某环境的编辑者权限，你的脚本代码会影响本地值，但不会同步或共享给团队。",
    "Postman supports variables at different scopes, allowing you to tailor your processing to a variety of development, testing, and collaboration tasks. Scopes in Postman relate to the different contexts that your requests run in, and different variable scopes are suited to different tasks.": "Postman 支持不同作用域的变量，让你能够针对各种开发、测试和协作任务定制处理方式。Postman 中的作用域对应你的请求运行时所处的不同上下文，不同的变量作用域适用于不同的任务。",
    "Remember to delete variables you're no longer using.": "记得删除你不再使用的变量。",
    "Select the data you need, for example in the address, parameters, headers, or body.": "选择你需要的数据，例如地址、参数、请求头或正文中的数据。",
    "Shared values are also used with Postman features that run on the Postman cloud, like scheduled collection runs, monitors, the Postman CLI, and Newman.": "共享值还会用于在 Postman 云端运行的功能，例如计划的集合运行、监视器、Postman CLI 和 Newman。",
    "Some Postman features that run on the Postman cloud also use the shared value when sending requests. These features include scheduled collection runs, monitors, the Postman CLI, and Newman.": "一些在 Postman 云端运行的功能在发送请求时也会使用共享值。这些功能包括计划的集合运行、监视器、Postman CLI 和 Newman。",
    "The environment that has the variable isn't active.": "含有该变量的环境未处于激活状态。",
    "The variable doesn't have a scope, and a value hasn't been added to it.": "该变量没有作用域，且尚未为其添加值。",
    "The variable is turned off in the respective collection, active environment, or globals.": "该变量在相应的集合、激活的环境或全局变量中被关闭了。",
    "The variable was created but changes weren't saved.": "变量已创建，但更改未保存。",
    "Turn on the variable, make the necessary changes to the value of the variable, or make the correct environment active.": "开启该变量、对变量的值做必要的修改，或激活正确的环境。",
    "When you hover over a variable, Postman shows its value and its scope. As you add variables to your requests, Postman displays any existing variables.": "当你悬停在某个变量上时，Postman 会显示它的值和作用域。当你向请求中添加变量时，Postman 会显示已有的变量。",
    "When you stop sharing a value, you may break API workflows that rely on it.": "当你停止共享某个值时，可能会破坏依赖它的 API 工作流。",
    "You can also create a vault secret without adding it to your Postman Vault.": "你也可以创建保险库密钥而不将其添加到 Postman Vault 中。",
    "You can also hover over the reference to the variable or vault secret, delete the existing value, then enter a new value.": "你也可以悬停在变量或保险库密钥的引用上，删除已有的值，然后输入新值。",
    "You can also stop sharing a shared value, removing it from the Postman cloud.": "你也可以停止共享某个共享值，将其从 Postman 云端移除。",
    "You can choose to share global, environment, and collection variables, syncing the values with the Postman cloud. By default, variables have a local value that only you can access in your instance of Postman.": "你可以选择共享全局、环境和集合变量，将这些值同步到 Postman 云端。默认情况下，变量的本地值只有你在自己的 Postman 实例中才能访问。",
    "You can create a shared value for a variable with Editor access to the element.": "拥有该元素的编辑者权限时，你可以为变量创建共享值。",
    "You can edit your local value of a variable or vault secret that's referenced in a request. Open the variables pane, delete the existing value next to a variable or vault secret, then enter a new value.": "你可以编辑请求中引用的变量或保险库密钥的本地值。打开变量面板，删除变量或保险库密钥旁的已有值，然后输入新值。",
    "You can set variables and vault secrets programmatically in your request scripts.": "你可以在请求脚本中以编程方式设置变量和保险库密钥。",
    "You can update a shared value for a variable with Editor access to the element. The shared value is updated based on your local value, sharing it with your teammates.": "拥有该元素的编辑者权限时，你可以更新变量的共享值。共享值会根据你的本地值更新，并共享给你的队友。",
    "You can use variables in request URLs, parameters, headers, authorization, body, and header presets.": "你可以在请求 URL、参数、请求头、授权、正文和请求头预设中使用变量。",
    "You need Editor access to an environment or collection to add variables to it.": "你需要某环境或集合的编辑者权限，才能向其添加变量。",
