    "The position of the element in the tabbing navigation order for the current document.": "元素在当前文档 Tab 导航顺序中的位置。",
    "Specifies weight of glyphs in the font, their degree of blackness or stroke thickness.": "指定字体中字形的粗细，即黑度或笔画厚度。",
    "The element's sequential navigation order is assigned automatically by the user agent.": "元素的顺序导航次序由用户代理自动分配。",
    "For floats an exclusion is created, for all other elements an exclusion is not created.": "对浮动元素创建排除区域，对其他所有元素则不创建。",
    "The user agent determines how the ruby contents are aligned. This is the initial value.": "由用户代理决定 ruby 内容的对齐方式。这是初始值。",
    "Scrolls in a smooth fashion using a user-agent-defined timing function and time period.": "使用用户代理定义的时间函数和时长平滑滚动。",
    "When evaluated in the context of a shadow tree, matches the shadow tree's host element.": "在 shadow 树上下文中求值时，匹配该 shadow 树的宿主元素。",
    "The ::placeholder CSS pseudo-element represents the placeholder text of a form element.": "::placeholder CSS 伪元素表示表单元素的占位符文本。",
    "The element generates a block container box, and lays out its contents using flow layout.": "元素生成块级容器盒，并使用流式布局排列其内容。",
    "Align the 'middle' baseline of the inline element with the middle baseline of the parent.": "将行内元素的 'middle' 基线与父元素的中线基线对齐。",
    "The contents of the element are considered to be inside a separate, independent paragraph.": "元素的内容被视为处于一个独立的段落中。",
    "Determines the mask painting area, which determines the area that is affected by the mask.": "确定遮罩绘制区域，即受遮罩影响的区域。",
    "Defines a name that can be used to identify an element as the source of a scroll-timeline.": "定义一个名称，用于将元素标识为 scroll-timeline 的来源。",
    "Specifies the marker that will be drawn at the last vertices of the given markable element.": "指定将在给定可标记元素最后顶点处绘制的标记。",
    "Specifies the marker that will be drawn at the first vertices of the given markable element.": "指定将在给定可标记元素首个顶点处绘制的标记。",
    "The -moz-orient CSS property specifies the orientation of the element to which it's applied.": "-moz-orient CSS 属性指定所应用元素的方向。",
    "The -webkit-mask-position-y CSS property sets the initial vertical position of a mask image.": "-webkit-mask-position-y CSS 属性设置遮罩图像的初始垂直位置。",
    "The box-ordinal-group CSS property assigns the flexbox's child elements to an ordinal group.": "box-ordinal-group CSS 属性将弹性盒的子元素分配到某个序号组。",
    "Selects a font that is labeled 'italic', or, if that is not available, one labeled 'oblique'.": "选择标记为 'italic' 的字体；若不可用，则选择标记为 'oblique' 的字体。",
    "The default contents of the of the list item's marker are given by 'list-style-type' instead.": "列表项标记的默认内容改由 'list-style-type' 指定。",
    "Defines named values for the indices used to select alternate glyphs for a given font family.": "为选择给定字体族替代字形所用的索引定义命名值。",
    "The -webkit-mask-position-x CSS property sets the initial horizontal position of a mask image.": "-webkit-mask-position-x CSS 属性设置遮罩图像的初始水平位置。",
    "The offset CSS property is a shorthand property for animating an element along a defined path.": "offset CSS 属性是沿指定路径为元素设置动画的简写属性。",
    "The white-space-collapse CSS property controls how white space inside an element is collapsed.": "white-space-collapse CSS 属性控制元素内空白的折叠方式。",
    "Size of an element in the direction opposite that of the direction specified by 'writing-mode'.": "元素在与 'writing-mode' 指定方向相反方向上的尺寸。",
