    "Specifies under what circumstances a given element can be the target element for a pointer event.": "指定在何种情况下给定元素可作为指针事件的目标元素。",
    "Defines the positioning of snap points along the x axis of the scroll container it is applied to.": "定义在所应用滚动容器的 x 轴上吸附点的定位。",
    "Defines the positioning of snap points along the y axis of the scroll container it is applied to.": "定义在所应用滚动容器的 y 轴上吸附点的定位。",
    "The user agent may determine any permitted touch behaviors for touches that begin on the element.": "对于起始于该元素的触摸，用户代理可自行决定任何允许的触摸行为。",
    "Specifies alignment of child elements within the current element in the direction of orientation.": "指定当前元素内子元素在方向轴上的对齐方式。",
