    "Determines which page-based occurrence of a given element is applied to a counter or string value.": "确定给定元素在分页中的哪一次出现应用于计数器或字符串值。",
    "Help is available for the object under the cursor. Often rendered as a question mark or a balloon.": "光标下的对象有可用帮助。通常渲染为问号或气泡。",
    "Shorthand property for the -ms-content-zoom-snap-type and -ms-content-zoom-snap-points properties.": "-ms-content-zoom-snap-type 和 -ms-content-zoom-snap-points 属性的简写属性。",
    "Sets or retrieves the size of the character grid used for rendering the text content of an element.": "设置或获取用于渲染元素文本内容的字符网格大小。",
    "The font-variant-emoji CSS property specifies the default presentation style for displaying emojis.": "font-variant-emoji CSS 属性指定显示表情符号的默认呈现样式。",
