    "Sets or retrieves the composite document grid properties that specify the layout of text characters.": "设置或获取用于指定文本字符布局的复合文档网格属性。",
    "Align the 'alphabetic' baseline of the element with the 'alphabetic' baseline of the parent element.": "将元素的 'alphabetic' 基线与父元素的 'alphabetic' 基线对齐。",
