    "The cross-start margin edge of the flexbox item is placed flush with the cross-start edge of the line.": "弹性盒项目的交叉起始外边距边缘与行的交叉起始边缘对齐。",
    "Maximum size of an element in the direction opposite that of the direction specified by 'writing-mode'.": "元素在与 'writing-mode' 指定方向相反方向上的最大尺寸。",
