    "Represents an element that is in the language specified. Accepts a comma separated list of language tokens.": "表示处于指定语言的元素。接受以逗号分隔的语言标记列表。",
    "The :picture-in-picture CSS pseudo-class matches the element which is currently in picture-in-picture mode.": ":picture-in-picture CSS 伪类匹配当前处于画中画模式的元素。",
