    "Enter a URL or cURL command Get started by adding the API request URL or cURL command to test an endpoint. A URL typically has a base location and a path. For example, https://postman-echo.com/get.": "输入 URL 或 cURL 命令。首先，添加用于测试端点的 API 请求 URL 或 cURL 命令。URL 通常由基础地址和路径组成。例如：https://postman-echo.com/get。",
