    "\"Before invoke\" scripts are written in JavaScript and run before the method is invoked.": "“调用前”脚本使用 JavaScript 编写，并在方法调用前运行。",
    "\"调用前\" scripts are written in JavaScript and run before the method is invoked.": "“调用前”脚本使用 JavaScript 编写，并在方法调用前运行。",
    "Before invoke scripts are written in JavaScript and run before the method is invoked.": "调用前脚本使用 JavaScript 编写，并在方法调用前运行。",
    "scripts are written in JavaScript and run before the method is invoked.": "脚本使用 JavaScript 编写，并在方法调用前运行。",
    "\"After response\" scripts are written in JavaScript and run after the response is received from the server and the connection with the server is terminated.": "“响应后”脚本使用 JavaScript 编写，并在收到服务器响应且服务器连接终止后运行。",
    "\"响应后\" scripts are written in JavaScript and run after the response is received from the server and the connection with the server is terminated.": "“响应后”脚本使用 JavaScript 编写，并在收到服务器响应且服务器连接终止后运行。",
    "After response scripts are written in JavaScript and run after the response is received from the server and the connection with the server is terminated.": "响应后脚本使用 JavaScript 编写，并在收到服务器响应且服务器连接终止后运行。",
    "scripts are written in JavaScript and run after the response is received from the server and the connection with the server is terminated.": "脚本使用 JavaScript 编写，并在收到服务器响应且服务器连接终止后运行。",
    "On message": "收到消息时",
