    "Configure the deadline to invoke and receive the response in milliseconds. To keep the connection open indefinitely, set to 0.": "配置调用并接收响应的截止时间（毫秒）。如需让连接无限期保持打开，请设为 0。",
    "Configure the value used to validate the common name in the server certificate.": "配置用于验证服务器证书通用名称的值。",
