    "查看 response fields with default values. Turning this OFF will omit such fields from the response.": "查看包含默认值的响应字段。关闭后，响应中将省略这些字段。",
    "Maximum allowed message size in MB. To receive messages of any size, set to 0.": "允许的最大消息大小（MB）。如需接收任意大小的消息，请设为 0。",
