    "Adjust settings to customize the behavior of the LLM. Note that not all models and providers support all settings.": "调整设置以自定义 LLM 的行为。请注意，并非所有模型和提供商都支持全部设置。",
    "Controls the randomness of the LLM response.": "控制 LLM 响应的随机性。",
