    "Temperature": "温度",
    "Seed": "随机种子",
    "Controls the randomness of the LLM response. Higher values increase creativity and variability, while lower values make responses more focused and deterministic.": "控制 LLM 响应的随机性。较高的值会增加创造性和变化性，较低的值会让响应更聚焦、更确定。",
    "Reduces the likelihood of the LLM mentioning new topics that haven't appeared in the conversation. Higher values discourage introducing new topics, maintaining coherence.": "降低 LLM 提及对话中未出现过的新主题的可能性。较高的值会抑制引入新主题，以保持连贯性。",
    "Discourages the LLM from repeating the same words or phrases frequently. Higher values promote diversity in word choice, reducing redundancy.": "抑制 LLM 频繁重复相同词语或短语。较高的值会提升用词多样性，减少冗余。",
    "Pass metadata for each message sent.": "为每条发送的消息传递元数据。",
    "A service definition makes the client aware of the services and methods.": "服务定义会让客户端了解可用的服务和方法。",
    "Load a .proto file from your local system or using a URL.": "从本地系统或 URL 加载 .proto 文件。",
